The classic puzzle: clear the field without setting off a mine.

Numbers tell how many of the eight cells around them hide mines; flag the ones you find, reveal
the rest. Beginner, Intermediate and Expert fields, or one of your own size, with the best time
of each kept. Plays with the mouse or the keyboard.

Also the example of how to build, sign and publish a BMDS package:
https://github.com/jthwho/bmds-apps
